verses.commentary:
28:4 "Blessed. . .offspring of your body. . .the herd. . .crops. . .flock" Many and healthy cattle and children were a
sign of covenant prosperity and wealth. The man with large families, large herds, was one who was blessed by God (cf. Deut. 7:13;
28:4,11; 30:9). These were physical signs of God's blessings to obedient covenant members (cf. Gen. 1:22,28).
